<h2 class="ed-section-heading" id="map"><span aria-hidden="true">01</span>Start with a room map</h2>
<p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">Draw your home's rooms on paper. Mark the router's location and the places where you normally work, stream or make calls. You do not need measurements or a professional floor plan. Use labels such as “study desk” rather than an address if you share the notes.</p>
<p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">Beside each location, record one ordinary task and what happened. Keep the device and task the same for the first comparison. This is a record of your experience, not a signal survey.</p>
